    "done_when": "The design document docs/research/converged-forward-solve-design.html states the two rules the lead locked on 2026-10-05 in the plan's field-representation decision and in section 2 of the plan, and nothing else in the document changes. Rule one: the field is the own-node quadratic everywhere except the saddle cell, whose support is built from the null's normal form (saddle position, Hessian eigen-directions and curvature corrections), never from level-set roots of the reconstructed flux. Rule two: the null position, gradient and Hessian are evaluated from the Biot coupling kernels' analytic derivatives of the booked current, never by differentiating the mesh flux. Done when: (a) the topology.read section carries a saddle-cell paragraph saying how the normal form gives the two separatrix branches through the saddle cell and how the per-cell plasma area fraction of the saddle cell and its edge-sharing neighbours is computed from those branches rather than from the quadratic's zero contour; (b) the budgets table keeps the measured half-order level-set figures as the before measurement and states the saddle-neighbourhood budget at the field's order, p equal to 2, as the acceptance; (c) the clause table carries test_saddle_support_order[analytic-row]: a five-rung probe on the diverted analytic state at 132, 300, 550, 1074 and 2616 realised cells whose saddle-cell membership error is asserted to converge at order at least 2; (d) the differentiation paragraph says the implicit-function derivative of a stationary position uses the kernel Hessian and that no derivative of the mesh flux is taken anywhere in the read; (e) the receipt-contents section says that npz, gz and json receipts above a few MB live on GPFS with a path pointer in the committed record while PNG and SVG stay in git, citing the plan decision key receipts-out-of-git; (f) the representation paragraphs cite the plan decision key field-representation; (g) `reckon audit-doc docs/research/converged-forward-solve-design.html --project nova` reports 0 errors and every edited sentence has one reading. Every uv command carries --no-sync and nothing runs uv sync.",
    "estimated_hours": null,
    "goal": "Bring the design document in line with the two lead-locked saddle rules: normal-form saddle support and Biot-kernel derivatives, never level-set roots or mesh-flux differentiation; plus the receipts-out-of-git decision.",
